It might be good to add a comment here, as the reason for doing this may not be exactly obvious at a glance:

```suggestion
	// Default the zoom to match the editor scale, but don't dezoom on editor scales below 100% to prevent pixel art from looking bad.
	sheet_zoom = MAX(1, EDSCALE);
```

Remember to squash the commits together after applying this suggestion. See [PR workflow](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/community/contributing/pr_workflow.html#mastering-the-pr-workflow-the-rebase) for instructions :slightly_smiling_face:
